OL,3,GNEWSANasa heads to Scottish Highlands
OL,4,Ain its search for life on Mars
OL,5,
OL,6,FNasa scientists are studying rocks in
OL,7,Fthe Scottish Highlands to help them
OL,8,Funderstand if there was once life on
OL,9,FMars.
OL,11,FThe US space agency announced last year
OL,12,Fthat its Perseverance rover had found
OL,13,Fpotential biosignatures, markings on
OL,14,Frocks possibly made by ancient
OL,15,Fmicrobes.
OL,17,FThis summer, scientists took samples
OL,18,Ffrom a geological feature called the
OL,19,FStoer Formation around Clachtoll, in
OL,20,FAssynt, in the north-west Highlands.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
