OL,3,GNEWSANasa heads to Scottish Highlands
OL,4,Ain its search for life on Mars
OL,5,
OL,6,FNasa said the area's rocks formed in
OL,7,Fenvironments comparable to ancient
OL,8,FMartian lakes and rivers, but could
OL,9,Falso hold evidence of microbial life
OL,10,Ffrom 1.2 billion years ago.
